  m_Name: signa
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueList:
  - The other signs won't tell you this, but we have a name. Or, rather, we HAD a
    name.
  - Management just decided to call us 'signs' when they first took over.
  - Yeah, back when we had shrines and followers? They called us 'Signa'.
  - But it's not all that bad.
  - At least management only took out the 'A' out of our name.
